      "english": "My Airplane"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "约翰是一个小男孩儿，他爱看书。他的妹妹夏洛特，爱玩儿游戏。",
      "traditional": "約翰是一個小男孩兒，他愛看書。他的妹妹夏洛特，愛玩兒遊戲。",
      "pinyin": "yuē hàn shì yí ge xiǎo nán hái'r tā ài kàn shū tā de mèi mei xià luò tè ài wán'r yóu xì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "John is a small boy, he loves to read. His younger sister Charlotte loves to play games."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "有一天，他的妹妹在愉快地玩儿和跑步，她踩了约翰的书。",
      "traditional": "有一天，他的妹妹在愉快地玩兒和跑步，她踩了約翰的書。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu yì tiān tā de mèi mei zài yú kuài de wán'r hé pǎo bù tā cǎi le yuē hàn de shū",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "约翰大叫：“那是我的飞机！”",
      "traditional": "約翰大叫：“那是我的飛機！”",
      "pinyin": "yuē hàn dà jiào nà shì wǒ de fēi jī",
      "english": "One day, when his younger sister was cheerfully playing and running around, she stepped on John’s book."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n     ",
      "traditional": "\n     ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "John shouted, “That’s my airplane!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "约翰的爸爸说：“儿子，那是你的书，不是你的飞机。”",
      "traditional": "約翰的爸爸說：“兒子，那是你的書，不是你的飛機。”",
      "pinyin": "yuē hàn de bà ba shuō ér zi nà shì nǐ de shū bú shì nǐ de fēi jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n     ",
      "traditional": "\n     ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "John’s dad said, “Son, that’s your book, it’s not your airplane.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "“但是爸爸，”约翰说，“在我看书的时候，书能带我飞去很多地方。所以书是我的飞机。”",
      "traditional": "“但是爸爸，”約翰說，“在我看書的時候，書能帶我飛去很多地方。所以書是我的飛機。”",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì bà ba yuē hàn shuō zài wǒ kàn shū de shí hou shū néng dài wǒ fēi qù hěn duō dì fang suǒ yǐ shū shì wǒ de fēi jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n     ",
      "traditional": "\n     ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“But Dad,” said John. “When I read, the book can fly me off to a lot of places. So the book is my airplane.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "爸爸笑了。",
      "traditional": "爸爸笑了。",
      "pinyin": "bà ba xiào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dad laughed."
    }
  ],
