      "My Airplane",
      "",
      "John is a small boy, he loves to read. His younger sister Charlotte loves to play games.",
      "",
      "One day, when his younger sister was cheerfully playing and running around, she stepped on John’s book.",
      "John shouted, “That’s my airplane!”",
      "",
      "John’s dad said, “Son, that’s your book, it’s not your airplane.”",
      "",
      "“But Dad,” said John. “When I read, the book can fly me off to a lot of places. So the book is my airplane.”",
      "",
      "Dad laughed.",
